<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Between the Stars</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html, body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #33263d 0%, #171520 45%, #08090d 100%);
    color: #f5eee6;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
}

body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px),
        radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 130px 150px, 210px 190px;
    background-position: 20px 30px, 80px 100px;
    opacity: .35;
    animation: stars 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

.content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
}

.label {
    color: #c9b9ca;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: normal;
    line-height: 2;
    margin: 0 0 50px;
}

.button {
    color: #f5eee6;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 15px 35px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    transition: .4s;
}

.button:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
}

@keyframes stars {
    from { opacity: .25; }
    to { opacity: .65; }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    h1 {
        font-size: 23px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="content">

    <div class="label">BETWEEN THE STARS</div>

    <h1>
        في مكان ما بين الهدوء والنجوم،
        <br>
        هناك شيء صغير ينتظرك.
    </h1>

    <a href="page2.html" class="button">
        Continue ✦
    </a>

</div>

</body>
</html>
